# Intentionally not ignored:
# - examples/ contains sanitized examples safe to commit.
# - tests/fixtures/ contains synthetic fixtures safe to commit.
# - schemas/ contains versioned output contracts.
# - CSV, JSON, PDF, and archive extensions are not ignored globally.
